sp("V04-E-009", "Health and medicine", "The hygiene hypothesis was popularised as a warning against cleanliness, which went beyond the evidence.", "Easy",
   ["For much of the twentieth century, the rise of allergies and asthma in wealthy countries puzzled doctors.",
    "One influential suggestion was that children raised in very clean surroundings meet too few microbes early in life.",
    "On this view, an immune system that is not kept busy with genuine threats begins to react against harmless things such as pollen and dust.",
    "The idea drew support from the observation that children who grow up on farms, among animals, seem less prone to allergies than children in cities.",
    "That popular version, however, went further than the evidence.",
    "The microbes that appear to matter are mostly those of soil, animals and a varied natural environment, not the germs that household cleaning removes, so the lesson is not to give up washing hands."],
   "Such findings were soon popularised as a warning that modern households had simply become too clean.",
   [1, 2, 4, 6],
   "'Such findings' needs findings before it, which the observation about farm children supplies, and the next sentence, 'That popular version', needs a popular version to refer to, which only the missing sentence supplies. The sentence therefore belongs at gap (3).",
   {1: "At gap (1) no findings have yet been described, so 'Such findings' has no referent.",
    2: "At gap (2) only the suggestion itself has been stated, and the sentence would separate it from 'On this view', which must follow it directly.",
    6: "At gap (4) the popular version has already been corrected; announcing it after the correction reverses the order, and 'That popular version' earlier would still lack a referent."},
   "Choosing gap (2) because the suggestion about clean surroundings sounds like the popular warning, missing that 'Such findings' needs evidence first.",
   "V04E-hygiene-hypothesis-allergies", "Backward reference 'Such findings' and the dangling 'That popular version' fix the gap quickly.",
   cognitive="Understanding")

